<!--
    Adaptive-icon foreground layer: "Halo". A play triangle inside a ring of
    32 waveform bars, all pure white (depth comes from per-bar alpha), drawn
    directly on the 108x108 canvas. Outer extent r = 32.7 around (54,54), so
    it stays inside the 66dp safe zone under every launcher mask.

    Being white-with-alpha only, this layer doubles as the <monochrome> alpha
    mask for Android 13+ themed icons (see mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml).

    Bar i of 32: t = i/32 * 2pi, angle t - pi/2 (bar 0 at the top),
    length = clamp(3.2, 11, 6.6 + 2.9 sin(3t + 0.5) + 1.5 sin(8t + 1.2)),
    from r = 20.5, alpha = 0.5 + 0.48 (length - 3.2) / 7.8.
-->
